'''''A Grand Cool Adventure''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[In the Withering Wintry Night]].

==Steps==
# Sit on the sofa and wait for the warp jump
# Find Dan Heng
# Talk to March 7th and set off on a new journey
# Search for traces of civilization in the Snow Plains

